WEBVTT

00:16.683 --> 00:17.559
Tomorrow at noon,

00:18.893 --> 00:20.562
you will have a visitor.

00:21.146 --> 00:22.522
But you must not meet him.

00:23.231 --> 00:25.817
You must not go to the visitation room.

00:25.900 --> 00:27.527
Someone's here to see you.

00:30.613 --> 00:32.657
Turn around. Go back to your room!

00:34.034 --> 00:35.744
Dad…

00:37.662 --> 00:38.538
Johngalli A.

00:39.330 --> 00:41.332
This man was behind it all.

00:41.958 --> 00:44.753
Johngalli A. is,
without a doubt, a Stand user.

00:45.336 --> 00:47.964
Just know that you are being targeted.

00:48.548 --> 00:49.924
I'll get you out immediately.

00:50.508 --> 00:51.342
My handcuffs!

00:51.926 --> 00:52.802
When did I get free?

00:53.428 --> 00:55.388
Jolyne, get away from that door!

00:56.681 --> 00:59.142
Star Platinum: The World!

01:00.101 --> 01:01.603
Time, stop!

01:08.693 --> 01:10.445
What happened just now?

01:10.528 --> 01:12.906
Stay still! The fight has already begun.

01:14.032 --> 01:15.575
Aerodynamics.

01:15.658 --> 01:19.120
It detected our positions
using aerodynamics.

01:19.871 --> 01:22.582
Do not make a move
until we understand the contraption.

01:23.208 --> 01:25.418
Don't order me around.

01:25.502 --> 01:30.590
-I know that!
-You… FE40536!

01:31.216 --> 01:33.885
Who do you think you're talking to?
You bastard!

01:33.968 --> 01:35.220
Jolyne!

01:42.519 --> 01:43.937
-You…
-Don't move!

01:49.776 --> 01:52.028
Keep your voice down.

01:52.821 --> 01:55.115
It'll detect our position again.

01:55.907 --> 01:59.577
Johngalli A. uses
that Stand to read the airflow.

01:59.661 --> 02:02.288
It may even react
to the change in our breathing.

02:02.956 --> 02:05.250
Plus, that Stand can be used remotely.

02:05.333 --> 02:09.129
He can shoot at that Stand
to reflect the bullet to his target.

02:09.212 --> 02:10.255
It's a sniping Stand.

02:11.131 --> 02:14.676
We cannot attack Johngalli A.,
who is in the men's prison.

02:15.343 --> 02:18.221
We have to destroy that long-range Stand.

02:18.304 --> 02:22.350
Any damage dealt
to the Stand is reflected on its user.

02:22.851 --> 02:23.685
I'm well aware.

02:23.768 --> 02:27.397
The problem is,
the moment we move to prompt an attack,

02:27.981 --> 02:32.026
the Stand will detect our position
and Johngalli A. will shoot at us.

02:49.460 --> 02:50.962
Stay by the wall, Jolyne!

02:51.754 --> 02:53.590
It's detecting your location!

02:55.008 --> 02:55.842
Jolyne,

02:56.551 --> 02:57.886
what are you thinking?

04:32.146 --> 04:35.858
EPISODE 4: THE VISITOR (2)

04:57.130 --> 04:59.132
Your own muscles cannot be trusted.

05:00.508 --> 05:02.719
When skin comes in contact with a breeze,

05:03.219 --> 05:06.764
the muscles have a twitching reflex.

05:07.432 --> 05:10.476
This is an automatic reflex
you cannot control.

05:12.312 --> 05:14.522
Therefore, I use my bones
to affix the rifle.

05:15.315 --> 05:17.650
Bones land firmly on the surface.

05:17.734 --> 05:20.028
The gun is as stable
as the surface itself.

05:20.111 --> 05:22.113
Its stability is something we can trust.

05:23.489 --> 05:26.409
Meteorologists may argue
that the direction of drafts

05:26.492 --> 05:27.869
cannot be predicted.

05:27.952 --> 05:30.371
That may be true, but only to an extent.

05:33.291 --> 05:36.210
Is this fly flying randomly?

05:37.170 --> 05:38.129
No.

05:38.963 --> 05:42.842
It flies while smelling things nearby
and feeling the air current.

05:43.509 --> 05:45.720
The wind is the fly's movement.

05:55.605 --> 05:57.982
Just as the guard said,

05:58.066 --> 05:59.984
Jotaro Kujo is here.

06:00.943 --> 06:03.321
He's here to see
his daughter, Jolyne Cujoh.

06:04.322 --> 06:07.658
The descendant of the Joestars
is in the visitation room

06:07.742 --> 06:09.577
at this very moment.

06:09.660 --> 06:13.289
Within range of my ability,
Downtown Transfer.

06:14.248 --> 06:16.959
Joestar…

06:17.043 --> 06:18.920
Joestar!

06:19.504 --> 06:21.923
My life will finally begin

06:22.006 --> 06:24.550
after I eradicate your family's blood!

06:24.634 --> 06:30.014
You will pay for robbing me
of the one who was my rock!

06:46.823 --> 06:47.949
I see.

06:48.449 --> 06:51.369
You said we have to destroy it, right?

06:51.452 --> 06:53.538
Look at its movement.

06:53.621 --> 06:56.082
It can't detect the wind
due to the precipitation.

06:56.165 --> 06:59.293
Now's my chance! Stone Ocean!

06:59.377 --> 07:01.421
No, wait! Look closer!

07:05.341 --> 07:07.760
It's evading every drop of water.

07:08.344 --> 07:10.763
It's reading the drops' air current
to avoid them.

07:11.848 --> 07:14.684
Jolyne, go back to the wall!
He's going to shoot at us!

07:18.229 --> 07:22.608
This isn't good.
Once the guards arrive, the air will stir!

07:27.655 --> 07:29.824
-Hey, listen!
-What?

07:31.617 --> 07:34.412
Hurry, move the base of the pillar!

07:35.079 --> 07:36.247
Kick it with all your might!

07:37.081 --> 07:40.293
-But you're…
-Don't worry about me.

07:40.376 --> 07:43.004
Got that? Please don't forget what I said.

07:43.087 --> 07:44.922
I want you to survive!

07:50.887 --> 07:52.722
I don't know why,

07:52.805 --> 07:55.224
but there's a descending hole
between the walls.

07:55.725 --> 07:57.226
It seems to be a passage.

07:58.060 --> 08:01.272
Maybe it leads to
the sewer or the vent.

08:01.856 --> 08:03.107
What is this?

08:03.191 --> 08:05.610
It may lead us to the outside.

08:05.693 --> 08:07.945
Let's go, Jolyne.
Seems it's our only option.

08:14.035 --> 08:16.078
-It flew away…
-No.

08:16.162 --> 08:17.455
It's still close.

08:18.039 --> 08:20.708
It's looking for
the perfect angle to snipe us.

08:20.791 --> 08:21.792
No…

08:23.252 --> 08:27.215
It's following the boy
on the other side of this door.

08:28.549 --> 08:31.761
He plans to hunt the boy
because he helped us escape.

08:31.844 --> 08:33.971
Jolyne, go down the hole!

08:34.055 --> 08:36.265
I came to break you out!

08:46.317 --> 08:48.069
Before I entered this room…

08:49.654 --> 08:52.782
he grabbed this arm of mine.

08:53.282 --> 08:54.200
I'm sure of it.

08:55.451 --> 08:57.495
I can't believe it, but he's here.

08:58.496 --> 09:01.207
He was just an ordinary kid
like you'd see at any park.

09:01.290 --> 09:04.335
And we don't know each other…
We're complete strangers.

09:05.086 --> 09:06.128
But…

09:06.212 --> 09:08.798
he grabbed my arm
with desperation in his eyes.

09:10.132 --> 09:14.428
The warmth of his hand
even felt as if he cared about me.

09:15.263 --> 09:17.932
I'm going back inside.

09:18.015 --> 09:19.850
Before he shoots the boy,

09:20.518 --> 09:22.520
I'll kill Johngalli A.!

09:26.440 --> 09:28.192
Good grief.

09:34.282 --> 09:35.533
To the visitation room!

09:35.616 --> 09:37.493
That's where the fire alarm went off!

09:37.994 --> 09:39.453
There are no cameras there.

09:39.537 --> 09:41.998
-Be prepared to engage!
-Where did he go?

09:45.459 --> 09:46.294
That boy…

09:46.377 --> 09:48.421
How does he move through this place,

09:48.504 --> 09:51.090
appearing and disappearing
out of nowhere?

09:55.970 --> 09:58.055
Hurry! To Visitation Room B!

10:04.228 --> 10:06.272
Did that boy dig this hole?

10:06.355 --> 10:09.191
This wall… So he used this!

10:14.989 --> 10:17.658
His height is about 140cm.

10:17.742 --> 10:20.453
His build is small, almost like a child's.

10:21.537 --> 10:23.164
I don't know who he is,

10:23.247 --> 10:26.042
but the hole
that suddenly opened is a vent.

10:26.125 --> 10:28.919
I know where it leads by reading the air.

10:29.003 --> 10:29.837
However…

10:30.796 --> 10:35.092
I can't have this small guy
guide Jotaro and his daughter

10:35.176 --> 10:38.929
deep underground
where I cannot reach them!

10:39.722 --> 10:41.641
I will not lose those two again!

10:42.224 --> 10:44.435
I'll finish this small one first!

10:46.812 --> 10:47.647
Jolyne,

10:48.397 --> 10:50.483
our situation is too dire.

10:51.400 --> 10:53.903
Our Stands are only good
for defense at the moment.

10:54.612 --> 10:57.907
Should we strike, Johngalli A. will read
the movement of the air.

10:58.991 --> 11:00.242
This is too dangerous.

11:00.743 --> 11:02.119
Hey, you!

11:02.203 --> 11:03.704
You can't just leave the room!

11:03.788 --> 11:04.872
This side is the prison!

11:04.955 --> 11:06.874
-Good grief.
-Leave from the other side!

11:07.458 --> 11:08.292
What the…

11:25.226 --> 11:26.227
There it is!

11:30.606 --> 11:33.317
Just as I thought, it's chasing the boy!

11:33.401 --> 11:36.028
But there aren't any windows here.

11:36.112 --> 11:38.781
How can he aim through the men's prison?

11:39.365 --> 11:41.992
No… However…

11:42.785 --> 11:45.287
This boy… Look at him!

11:46.330 --> 11:47.623
How smart!

11:47.707 --> 11:49.917
No, we're blessed!

11:50.000 --> 11:53.254
With his body submerged completely
underwater, the air is unaffected!

11:53.337 --> 11:55.005
And, he's inside a pipe!

11:55.089 --> 11:57.717
Johngalli A. cannot find him now!

11:57.800 --> 12:00.219
Not only that,
there are no windows down here.

12:00.302 --> 12:02.179
Surely he can't shoot him now…

12:04.432 --> 12:08.018
The pipe is bursting! But how?
Where is he aiming from?

12:12.606 --> 12:13.482
Could he be…

12:25.286 --> 12:27.663
Distance to the target is 321m.

12:27.747 --> 12:31.041
The bullet drops 9,5cm while airborne,

12:31.125 --> 12:34.378
and there's a slight ocean breeze of
3,2 meters per second.

12:34.462 --> 12:37.047
The bullet will drift
by 4,2cm to the left.

12:38.007 --> 12:39.133
Finding its target.

12:39.633 --> 12:42.344
Targeting his heart.

12:42.428 --> 12:43.304
Shit!

12:43.387 --> 12:45.264
Stone Ocean!

12:47.683 --> 12:48.684
Threads!

12:48.768 --> 12:52.605
Jolyne Cujoh… This is her Stand ability!

12:52.688 --> 12:54.607
She followed the boy down?

12:54.690 --> 12:55.649
Is she an imbecile!

12:56.317 --> 12:58.360
She thinks her net can stop my bullet?

12:58.944 --> 13:00.863
Changing my target to Jolyne Cujoh.

13:00.946 --> 13:02.573
Targeting the forehead.

13:03.491 --> 13:05.534
Now, shoot!

13:21.175 --> 13:22.384
How?

13:23.844 --> 13:27.223
I'm so glad I broke this pipe beforehand.

13:28.474 --> 13:33.437
The moment I came in,
I punctured this gas line.

13:34.021 --> 13:35.940
Gas is lighter than air.

13:36.023 --> 13:40.653
It creates a layer of gas
separate from oxygen.

13:40.736 --> 13:43.239
I thought it would obscure your aim.

13:44.532 --> 13:45.825
Man, was I right.

13:47.034 --> 13:48.035
How did she do this?

13:48.118 --> 13:50.621
You're too late! You're mine now!

13:50.704 --> 13:53.082
Stone Ocean!

13:58.963 --> 14:01.882
Seems you couldn't read your own fate.

14:06.971 --> 14:08.848
STAND NAME: DOWNTOWN TRANSFER
STAND MASTER: JOHNGALLI A.

14:12.810 --> 14:13.894
Who are you?

14:15.312 --> 14:18.983
How is a child like you
roaming freely about this prison?

14:24.405 --> 14:25.406
I hit myself.

14:27.658 --> 14:28.492
This bone.

14:28.576 --> 14:31.328
That's right. You gave me this.

14:31.412 --> 14:32.413
What is it?

14:33.205 --> 14:36.417
It looks like a bone. What's going on?

14:36.500 --> 14:38.794
You tried to stop me
from going to the visitation room.

14:38.878 --> 14:40.337
Just what do you know?

14:42.631 --> 14:43.632
Hey, answer me!

14:43.716 --> 14:46.760
Not yet… I can't, yet.

14:47.803 --> 14:49.972
You mustn't let that go.

14:53.100 --> 14:54.226
This smell.

14:55.352 --> 14:56.770
Is this your doing?

14:56.854 --> 14:59.690
That sniper guy, Johngalli A., his Stand?

14:59.773 --> 15:01.734
It was nothing once I got to it.

15:02.651 --> 15:04.904
I pounded it into a thousand pieces.

15:04.987 --> 15:06.530
I see.

15:06.614 --> 15:10.576
It seems you're quite used to
fighting with your Stand.

15:10.659 --> 15:12.077
Not out of choice…

15:21.462 --> 15:23.464
There he is! Right there!

15:23.547 --> 15:24.465
He's on the move!

15:27.259 --> 15:29.678
Hide! He has a rifle.

15:29.762 --> 15:31.347
He's hiding behind that pipe.

15:31.430 --> 15:33.015
I saw him going above the tank!

15:33.724 --> 15:35.059
That's impossible.

15:35.726 --> 15:39.438
He was targeting from the men's prison,
which is 200 to 300m away.

15:40.064 --> 15:41.982
There are layers of bars between us.

15:42.066 --> 15:44.276
Not only that,
he is almost completely blind.

15:44.360 --> 15:47.154
How do you suppose he traveled so fast?

15:47.237 --> 15:50.324
How the hell should I know?
If I said he's here, he's here!

15:50.407 --> 15:51.241
Hide!

15:53.077 --> 15:55.412
He's directly above you!

15:56.789 --> 15:59.166
All right, I believe you.

16:01.835 --> 16:03.170
And get ready.

16:03.963 --> 16:06.590
The gas must have been accumulating.

16:15.975 --> 16:16.892
We did it!

16:17.476 --> 16:19.269
Hey, we're safe now!

16:20.437 --> 16:21.480
What the…

16:21.563 --> 16:23.565
Where did he run off to?

16:25.150 --> 16:27.111
Are you hiding?

16:27.194 --> 16:29.113
You don't have to be afraid anymore.

16:29.196 --> 16:31.073
Come out and explain what's going on!

16:31.156 --> 16:32.908
What are you doing?

16:32.992 --> 16:34.660
I'm looking for the boy.

16:34.743 --> 16:36.704
Did you see where he went?

16:37.621 --> 16:39.456
I don't understand what you mean.

16:40.124 --> 16:42.042
What boy are you talking about?

16:44.336 --> 16:46.046
Oh, I see.

16:46.130 --> 16:48.132
You didn't see him, did you?

16:48.632 --> 16:52.511
I was talking to a little boy
outside the visitation room.

16:52.594 --> 16:55.597
Johngalli A. tried to
get rid of him first.

16:55.681 --> 16:56.557
Get rid of him?

16:58.017 --> 17:00.227
What are you talking about?

17:00.811 --> 17:03.355
You came here on your own.

17:04.398 --> 17:06.316
And so I followed you.

17:06.400 --> 17:09.194
Hold on, our stories aren't matching up.

17:09.278 --> 17:11.697
You must have heard his voice.

17:11.780 --> 17:14.199
No, I know you did!

17:14.283 --> 17:17.286
He's the one who told us
about the secret passage!

17:17.369 --> 17:18.871
You were there with me!

17:19.496 --> 17:21.206
Did you hear a ghost or something?

17:21.790 --> 17:23.542
I don't know of a secret passage.

17:23.625 --> 17:27.337
Damn you! You're messing with me
at a time like this?

17:27.421 --> 17:30.549
You're here now because
you followed me down the secret tunnel…

17:33.635 --> 17:34.553
Hold on…

17:36.055 --> 17:38.474
Something's not right with you.

17:39.183 --> 17:40.017
Your wound…

17:41.393 --> 17:43.520
You were shot.
What happened to your wound?

17:43.604 --> 17:44.438
Wound?

17:44.521 --> 17:46.774
The bullet wound
from when Johngalli A. shot you!

17:46.857 --> 17:48.108
On your right shoulder.

17:48.192 --> 17:51.403
But you aren't bleeding, and your clothes…

17:53.072 --> 17:55.657
I don't have a scratch
from being shot either!

17:56.617 --> 17:57.993
This man…

18:00.079 --> 18:03.040
He isn't Johngalli A.!
He's the prison guard!

18:03.624 --> 18:06.835
But I saw him get shot through the head!

18:06.919 --> 18:08.253
His head is unscathed!

18:09.254 --> 18:11.423
What do you mean he was shot?

18:11.507 --> 18:13.509
And who is Johngalli A.?

18:14.093 --> 18:16.553
What's going on?

18:16.637 --> 18:18.388
Something's amiss.

18:18.472 --> 18:20.057
It's not adding up!

18:25.604 --> 18:28.023
What is this?

18:35.781 --> 18:38.909
A fate more terrible than death
will await us all.

18:40.119 --> 18:42.913
You must not go to the visitation room.

18:42.996 --> 18:44.206
The visitation room…

18:44.915 --> 18:47.709
That's right. Something was off
from the very beginning.

18:48.293 --> 18:51.380
When was I uncuffed?

18:51.964 --> 18:53.799
And that bullet…

18:53.882 --> 18:55.592
Was I really shot back there?

18:57.302 --> 19:00.222
But my dad and I don't have a scratch.

19:00.722 --> 19:05.144
Was Johngalli A.
attacking us to begin with?

19:05.811 --> 19:07.396
Something's wrong.

19:07.479 --> 19:09.898
Nothing is making sense!

19:12.985 --> 19:14.903
This isn't reality!

19:15.612 --> 19:17.114
I'm in a dream of some sort.

19:17.948 --> 19:20.075
No, I'm under someone's spell!

19:20.576 --> 19:23.328
This is…

19:37.968 --> 19:39.052
A dream…

19:40.470 --> 19:43.432
Was I… dreaming?

19:44.808 --> 19:46.560
Since when…

19:50.606 --> 19:53.066
It looks like I did

19:54.026 --> 19:55.444
knock out this prison guard.

19:56.945 --> 19:59.156
This photo of Johngalli A…

20:01.408 --> 20:03.827
Dad showed it to me.

20:05.120 --> 20:07.956
The accident with the hitchhiker.

20:08.040 --> 20:11.877
I heard that it was all
a plot to imprison me.

20:12.836 --> 20:14.171
That was all real.

20:15.964 --> 20:18.717
And then I tried to leave the room.

20:19.801 --> 20:21.887
That's when I noticed I was uncuffed.

20:23.263 --> 20:24.389
That was the moment.

20:26.350 --> 20:29.436
No, I was sitting down when I awoke.

20:29.937 --> 20:31.104
So before then…

20:32.272 --> 20:35.859
We haven't stepped outside
of this visitation room.

20:36.944 --> 20:37.903
In other words…

20:39.363 --> 20:41.490
Johngalli A.'s Stand

20:42.074 --> 20:45.452
was an illusion my mind created.

20:50.207 --> 20:52.376
The secret passageway too.

20:53.543 --> 20:56.797
The moment we stepped into
this visitation room,

20:57.839 --> 21:01.677
we fell under their trap
and were forced to dream.

21:02.678 --> 21:04.513
As if engulfed by a python,

21:04.596 --> 21:07.516
slowly but surely,

21:08.183 --> 21:09.768
we're being melted to the bone!

21:10.560 --> 21:13.438
The boy in the garbage can
who gave me this bone.

21:13.939 --> 21:15.482
He was real!

21:17.109 --> 21:19.236
I was able to wake up

21:19.820 --> 21:22.155
because I cut myself on this bone!

21:22.864 --> 21:24.866
Without the pain from the cut,

21:24.950 --> 21:26.952
I would have stayed asleep.

21:28.787 --> 21:33.083
This ability is Johngalli A.'s attack!

21:38.046 --> 21:41.216
My thread! I can't unravel it,
not even for a few centimeters!

21:43.051 --> 21:44.469
This is bad!

21:47.055 --> 21:48.140
Dammit.

21:49.141 --> 21:51.810
I'm getting sleepy again…

21:52.811 --> 21:55.814
We need to get out of here.

21:58.442 --> 22:01.236
Out of this visitation room!

22:11.997 --> 22:15.834
Stone Ocean!

23:41.253 --> 23:46.258
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
